elf"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A maximum independent set (exact), in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order; [] for the empty graph. A vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a self-loop is never in it; parallel edges count once. Deterministic, but which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"maximum set it is depends on the search; for one fixed by a rule, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"lexicographicallyFirstMaximumIndependentSet()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}}}